{"id":"u-e4c30f92-8ba4-45f7-b0dc-6a64068076c4","src":"community","title":"V-Shape Build","author":"Baha B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/oIK1yo-v-shape-foundation-1","desc":"The second phase of the V-Shape training plan. This program increases training volume and intensity to build more muscle, improve strength and develop a wider upper body while keeping the waist lean.\n\nThe main priorities are the back, shoulders, upper chest and core, while maintaining balanced leg development.\n\nWeekly structure:\n\nMonday: Upper A\nTuesday: Lower A + Core\nWednesday: Zone 2 cardio\nThursday: Upper B\nFriday: Rest / walking\nSaturday: Lower B + Core\nSunday: Zone 2 cardio or recovery\n\nMain goals:\n\nIncrease muscle mass\nDevelop wider shoulders and lats\nImprove upper chest thickness\nProgressively increase training loads\nStrengthen the core\nImprove body composition\nMaintain or gradually reduce waist circumference\n\nTraining principles:\n\nProgressive overload\nDouble progression on major exercises\nMostly 1–2 repetitions in reserve\nCompound exercises performed before isolation work\nIncreased weekly training volume\nControlled execution and full range of motion\n2 Zone 2 cardio sessions per week\nRecovery and performance monitored weekly\n\nThis phase bridges beginner training and intermediate hypertrophy training.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-01T16:06:07.337Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Monday- Upper A","Thursday- Lower A + abdos","Wednesday- Zone 2","Tuesday- Upper B","Friday- Lower B + abdos","Sunday- cardio"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}],"rest":120},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}],"rest":120},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}],"rest":120},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"